                        "entry_id": "347d763e-bbcc-3d8c-960c-b075a5bb890f",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Any of a group of gram-negative bacteria, of the genus Rickettsia, carried as parasites by ticks, fleas and lice, that cause typhus and other diseases."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
